#   - C-route chain: gen0 (cc, `-pthread`, from bootstrap `26b6ca48`) built the tree → tc1 `4afdb38a` (TRANSITIONAL
#     — old preamble); tc1 -> gen1; gen1 built the tree → tc2 `49e5a64c69d33680101a5a64a047e767b6a399a84b44bf394d
